{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_32020",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A dihydroxy monocarboxylic acid that is (6<i>E</i>)-7-[2-cyclopropyl-4-(4-fluorophenyl)quinolin-3-yl]hept-6-enoic acid in which the two hydroxy groups are located at positions 3 and 5 (the 3<i>R</i>,5<i>S</i>-stereoisomer). Used as its calcium salt for treatment of hypercholesterolemia (elevated levels of cholesterol in the blood) on patients unable to sufficiently lower their cholesterol levels by diet and exercise."
  ],
